. Your tool for creating the optical illusion pathways is merely changing the view perspective. If two distant platforms look from a certain view angle as if they touch each other then the ball can roll over from one platform to the other, like over a virtual bridge. This way you can create virtual bridges, virtual walls or shift the ball sideways by scratching one platform over another.\n\n    • 66 levels\n    • No advertisements\n    • No In-App Purchases. All content is unlocked.", "sellerName": "Daniel Koenig-Meier", "userRatingCount": 9}]}